{
  "slug": "cc-wechat",
  "name": "Cc Wechat",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "WeChat channel for Claude Code — bridges your personal WeChat account to a Claude Code session via Tencent's iLink bot API. Supports two-way messaging (receive WeChat messages, reply from Claude Code) and permission relay (approve/deny tool use from your phone). QR code login via MCP elicitation, sender allowlist for security, and cursor persistence across reconnects.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `wechat`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cc-wechat@claude-community` from `uetuluk/cc-wechat`.\n\nA Claude Code channel that bridges your personal WeChat account to a Claude Code session via Tencent's iLink bot API. Two-way messaging with permission relay support.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
